  <reporting-org ref="FI-3" type="10">Ministry of Foreign Affairs, Finland</reporting-org>
  <title xml:lang="EN">Support to FLEGT process in Vietnam and Laos</title>
  <description xml:lang="EN">To make available a FLEGT advisor that support the implementation of the EU FLEGT Action Plan in Vietnam and in Laos, with emphasis on forest and timber industry governance reform, and trans boundary trade in the Mekong sub-region; to provide support to the Governments and stakeholders of Vietnam and Laos to come to an effective bilateral or trilateral FLEGT arrangement aimed ensuring that exports of timber products to the EU are made of legally harvested timber.</description>
